# The full ensemble on its own seed in windows of 960 ticks, the arranger switched on while it plays (it adopts
# the running ensemble and settles into the bed), three advances, two of them in one bar; the bass locked just
# after the arranger nudges it (the nudge then leaves the locked pattern alone) and while the arranger picks its
# targets; the arranger off at bar 128 (left on, it reaches its ending at bar 175) and on again at bar 208 over
# the voices it left playing (a build); these two switches and an advance pending at a 16-bar line.
template full
window 960
bars 400
at 76800 arranger on
at 115200 advance
at 119000 advance
at 119100 advance
at 165200 lock bass 1
at 345600 lock bass 0
at 491000 arranger off
at 798000 arranger on
at 798100 advance
